Z||000002||Oreif||07-18-2001||01:34 AM||||I read thru all 16 series links. It's a 522 cubic inch Big Block V-8. Originally he was going to use a single 2-stage Whipple supercarger with a 2100CFM throttle body for 1000hp. Now it's a Quad Whipple with 4200CFM!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR>$32000 just on the engine alone! <BR>I wonder if the 2-stage whipple will fit on a SBC350? That would look awesome sticking out of the decklid of a Fiero! (see series 1 and 3 for the SC pics). I think I could be happy sitting at 600hp. (just a guess on the HP)<BR>A car that weighs over 1200 pounds less than a Viper with more HP!<BR>The only problem I see would be trying to sell the car. Especially after the state revokes my license forever and I have to hire a limo and driver to get to and from work.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>"...but officer I really don't think I was going 250mph, the speedo stopped at 200mph"<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||4
